## 1.3.4b - JOHTO UPDATE

- Fixed wrong **Brock's Gym** and **Erika's Gym**;
- Added **Johto series**, with all Johto's Gym Leaders, Elite Four members and Johto's Champion; 
- Added 8 new custom structures: **Valerio's Gym**, **Raffaello's Gym**, **Chiara's Gym**, **Angelo's Gym**, **Furio's Gym**, **Jasmine's Gym**, **Alfredo's Gym**, **Sandra's Gym**;
- Added **Johto League Tower**, along with the **Champion** battle;
- Players now receive a custom book when they beat the Champion of Kanto for the first time;
- Added **custom animated skins** for all Johto trainers;
- Fixed missing FishingNav recipe;
- Updated **Mega Showdown** and **Lucky's Cozy Home**;
- Added **Handcrafted** mod;
- Lots of new furniture items added, including **fountains**, **bathtubes**, **benches**, **3D beds**, **chimneys**, **pillars** and many more;
- Added many ultra-rare items inside our new exclusive custom structures;
- Added new images to the main menu slideshow;
- Various fixes.

### IMPORTANT:
**The Johto region** and its related commands (like /locate) will automatically unlock **only after you’ve defeated Kanto’s Champion**, Blue.
This means you won’t find any Johto Gyms in your world until you’ve achieved that.

After defeating Blue, you’ll need to **explore new chunks** in order to discover the new Gyms.

Unlocking the Johto region does not interfere with the Kanto Gyms; they will continue to spawn as usual in their respective biomes.

If you’ve already completed the Kanto series and want to begin your journey in Johto, follow these steps:
- After updating the modpack (**v1.3.4b**), run this command: /datapack enable COBBLEVERSE-Johto-DP.zip
- Close your world or restart your server
- Then use this command: /rctmod player set series johto

**WARNING**: doing this, or using the in-game book you receive after beating Blue, will reset your Level Cap to 25.

You can also switch your series by trading your Kanto Trainer Card for a **Johto Trainer Card** with a **Trainer Association villager**.
And of course, it works the other way around too: you can restart your Kanto series if you want.
But keep in mind you can only have one active at a time!


# HAVE FUN! 


_**PLEASE READ**_: If you're experiencing any issues or would like to share your feedback, please join our **[Discord](https://discord.lumy.fun/)**.

![COBBLEVERSE 1.3.3 Update](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/28612264dc96eda5ab8725a39534fe7ee23c4547.png)

## 1.3.3

- Added **Map Guides**, who sell maps leading to **Gyms**. They spawn naturally in certain vanilla villages, and you can also craft a **_regional_** **Cartography Table** and place it next to an unemployed villager;
- For now, only **Kanto Map Guides** are available, but more will be added after new regions (like Johto, which is coming very soon) are introduced;
- Players now receive a **Starter Map** after choosing their Starter Pokémon. This map points to the **first Gym** (Brock's), helping new players get started and understand how to raise their Level Cap;
- Maps are now retained upon death;
- **Gym Leaders** shown in the **Trainer Card** now display their **exact spawn biome**;
- Added the **FishingNav**, which helps players see which Pokémon can be fished in their current location: hold it in your off-hand and Shift+right-click while fishing to open it properly;
- You can now **Dynamax your Pokémon** if you have the required item equipped and your Pokémon is close to a Power Spot block (both features are currently **only accessible via Cheats**);
- New models for **Mewtwo X** and **Mewtwo Y**;
- Added a datapack for **Mega Showdown items**: many of the most requested ones can now be found in certain structures, with more methods of obtaining them planned for the future;
- Updated **in-game Book**. If you lose it, use the command _/function help:get_book_ to get a new copy;
- **Mega Rayquaza** mount fixed;
- New models for **Paldean Tauros**, which now also spawn with the correct Type;
- Added a variety of **new furniture items**, including more Pokémon statues, various floor styles, plants, and PokéBall-themed chairs and desks;
- Added **Better Nether Map**, **CobbleCuisine**, **AdvancementDisable**, **MoreVillagers: Re-employed** and **VillagerConfig**;
- Introduced many new **food items**, such as **Poké Puffs** and **Masaladas** to help increase your Pokémon’s Friendship level;
- Added **Curries**, **Sandwiches** and other special foods to help you catch your most desidered Pokémon (and yes, one of them can **temporarily boost shiny spawn rates**... but it won’t be easy to get!);
- Don't worry: all new food items can be eaten even with a full hunger bar;
- Several tweaks made to **Advancements**;
- Gym maps are no longer obtainable from standard Cartographers or Wandering Traders;
- Updated **Mega Showdown**, **PokéNav**, **FancyMenu**, **CobbleFurnies**, **TMCraft** and **Waystones**;
- Fixed statue orientation issues in Gyms;
- Fixed Klefki texture;
- Various tweaks to improve overall experience and polish the gameplay.

# HAVE FUN! 


_**PLEASE READ**_: If you're experiencing any issues or would like to share your feedback, please join our **[Discord](https://discord.lumy.fun/)**.

![COBBLEVERSE 1.3.2 Update](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1c2fd218bb6f4047d047f8df7cc97577e90b5e2c_0.webp)

## 1.3.2

- **New Structure** in the Badlands: the **Team Rocket Tower**, inspired by the **Goldenrod City Radio Tower** from Pokémon Gold/Silver/Crystal. It’s packed with rare loot and Team Rocket agents ready to challenge you;
- To address the loot issue caused by the removal of mobs, we’ve added **Trial Keys** and **Ominous Trial Keys** to the Team Rocket Tower, where you can also find **Z-Crystals**;
- New Pokémon available: **Wormadam** and **Mothim**;
- **Reworked mob removal system**: no more invisible mobs attacking you;
- Removed **You Shall Not Spawn** and **Global Datapacks** mods;
- **New datapack loading system**: commands like "/locate" now work instantly, without needing to exit and re-enter the world;
- Added a variety of **new furniture items**, including desks, counters, sofas, lamps, tables, chairs, clocks, mirrors, and cushions;
- Added **Global Packs** and **Lucky's Cozy Home** mods;
- Yveltal, Zacian, and Zamazenta mounts are now working properly;
- New rideable Pokémon: **Manectric**;
- New crafting recipes for many Mega Showdown items;
- Added new items to DropConfirm and LenientDeath;
- Updated **in-game book**: now includes more detailed information. If you lose it, use the command "_/function help:get_book_" to get a new copy;
- Mr. Rime and Bogged models have been fixed (thanks again for reporting all the issues in our [#feedback](https://discord.lumy.fun/) channel!);
- Almost all datapacks, shaders and some resource packs have been renamed for better formatting and organization;
- Rebalanced and refreshed loot across various structures generated in custom villages;
- Updated: **DropConfirm**, **Mega Showdown**, **ModernFix**, **Cobblemon Additions**, **Fresh Animations**;
- A ton of work has been done to improve the modpack and make it more **"future-proof"** for upcoming updates.

# HAVE FUN! 


_**PLEASE READ**_: If you're experiencing any issues or would like to share your feedback, please join our **[Discord](https://discord.lumy.fun/)**.

![COBBLEVERSE 1.3.1 Update](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0c2da366dadf2d21ea35778451b888a3fb26a2dd_0.webp)

## 1.3.1

- New Pokémon available: **Deoxys** (Attack, Defense and Speed Formes), **Oricorio** (Baile, Pom-Pom, Pa'u and Sensu Styles), **Burmy** (Plant, Sandy and Trash Cloaks), **Enamorus**;
- Fixed Evolutions / Forme Change for (hopefully) all Pokémon, including: **Kubfu**, **Palkia**, **Dialga**, **Giratina**, **Necrozma**;
- You can activate **Ultra Necrozma** outside of battles by looking at Dusk-Mane Necrozma or Dawn-Wings Necrozma and pressing "**U**" (it must be holding the **Ultranecrozium-Z**);
- You can change **Arceus**'s Type using **Z-Crystals**;
- Added 2 new structures: **Rotom Shed** and **Regigigas Temple**;
- Improved models for: **Mega Beedrill**, **Deoxys**, **Palkia Origin Forme**, **Dialga Origin Forme**, **Necrozma Dawn-Wings**, **Necrozma Dusk-Mane**, **Yveltal**;
- New Pokémon rideable: **Mareep**, **Armaldo**, **Sealeo**, **Walrein**, **Gastrodon**, **Regigigas**, **Arceus**, **Pyroar**, **Gogoat**, **Volcanion**, **Silvally**, **Type:Null**, **Lunala**, **Stakataka**, **Duraludon**, **Yveltal**, **Appletun**, **Togekiss**, **Regieleki**, **Regidrago**, **Registeel**, **Regirock**, **Regice**, **Toedscruel**, **Dudunsparce**, **Baxcalibur**, **Roaring Moon**;
- Fixed mounts for: **Drednaw**, **Charizard**, **Dragapult**, **Solgaleo**;
- Added a lot of new **Poké Dolls**;
- **Trainer Cards** will now open even while holding another item in the offhand;
- **Badge Advancements** are now shown correctly;
- Updated: **Cobblemon Legendary**, **Fight of Flight**, **Cobblemon Interface: Modded**, **Cobbreeding**, **Entity Culling**, **Fabric API**, **Forgiving Void**, **ImmediatelyFast**, **Mega Showdown**, **Not Enough Animations**, **Ping Wheel**, **PokeBlocks**, **Radical Cobblemon Trainers**, **Sound Physics Remastered**, **Wavey Capes**;
- Reworked many Resource Packs and Datapacks to ensure they function seamlessly together;
- Changed the Waypoints key from U to **N**;
- Several other fixes and improvements.

# HAVE FUN! 


_**PLEASE READ**_: If you're experiencing any issues or would like to share your feedback, please join our **[Discord](https://discord.lumy.fun/)**.

