## This update was an April Fools' joke! Thanks for trying it out; we hope you enjoyed it! =P

### **WARNING: DO NOT USE THIS VERSION IN YOUR EXISTING WORLDS! CREATE A NEW ONE TO PLAY! THIS IS AN ALPHA VERSION OF POSSIBLE UPCOMING FEATURES! IT IS NOT READY TO BE USED ON SERVERS!**
## 1.4 - ALPHA

- **New Starters** available;
- Improved **Shiny Rate**;
- Reduced **egg hatching** time;
- You can now **breed Ditto with another Ditto** to get random Pokémon (including Legendary ones);
- Catching a wild Pokémon grants your Pokémon **more experience**;
- CobbleMerchant items are now cheaper, and you can sell your items (**Emeralds, Relic Coins**) at higher prices;
- Pokémon of the same species can have **different sizes**;
- Self Destruct and Explosion moves **deal more damage**;
- **Fossil Machine** now takes less time to complete the process;
- You can place a **Relic Coin** inside the Fossil Machine to get a random Pokémon;
- Increased Shiny Rate for **Fossils**;
- After receiving numerous requests on our [Discord](https://discord.lumy.fun/), **all Pokémon are now rideable**;
- Pokémon may spawn as **Alpha**, like in Legends Arceus;
- Tweaked Loot;
- **Improved spawn rates** of many Pokémon;
- Wild Pokémon can **spawn randomly in tall grass**, like in the original games;
- **Enhanced cries** for lots of Pokémon;
- **Revamped sounds** for Poké Balls, Pokédex and PC;
- **New water texture** (only visible with Shaders turned off);
- **3D models** for PokéNavs and PokéFinders;
- **New Pokémon icons** for the Minimap;
- New **Pokémon-themed GUI**;
- Better **Shiny particles** and sounds;
- **Improved Poké Balls models**;
- Many other tweaks and minor changes.

# HAVE FUN! BUT REMEMBER THIS IS AN ALPHA-SNAPSHOT!
Testing versions can corrupt your world, so please backup and/or run them in a different folder from your main worlds.


_**PLEASE READ**: If you're experiencing any issues or would like to share your feedback, please join our **[Discord](https://discord.lumy.fun/)**._
